**Ground surface type function:**
```js
function surfaceType(x,z){
  const pond = pondSDF(x,z);
  const dPath = distToPath(x,z);
  if (dPath < 0.9) return 'stone';
  const m = mossNoise(x,z);
  if (m > 0.18) return 'moss';
  return 'gravel';
}
```

Colors:
